text He seems to be installing a street light.
text I recall seeing this scene somewhere else in the past.
text When I was a student, I helped someone do this job for just a day.
text And I should have learned something that day.
music ~
text I should have learned just how carefree the life I was leading was.
text As well as how harsh the world that awaited me was.
